Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 19:48:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 10/25] Fix metadata type handling to resolve AttributeError in
 RAG pipeline

- Add `normalize_metadata` utility in `src/processing/text_cleaner.py` to safely convert JSON-string metadata from SQLite/Chroma into dictionaries, preventing `'str' object has no attribute 'items'` errors.
- Update `src/llm/prompt_builder.py` to use normalized metadata for source formatting and entity tagging, ensuring robust access to fields like `title`, `page_number`, and `entity_type`.
- Refactor `src/llm/rag_pipeline.py` to apply metadata normalization across hybrid search merging, graph expansion (`_expand_with_graph`), chunk merging (`_merge_adjacent_chunks`), and source extraction (`_extract_sources`).
- Enhance prompt engineering in `prompt_builder.py` with stricter mathematical correctness rules (punctured neighborhoods) and improved summary/chapter generation instructions to prevent raw OCR text leakage.
